meta {
  name: 11 Chat Runs
  seq: 12
}

docs {
  The turn routes of `/api/chats/{id}`: reattaching (`stream`), stop, regenerate, retry, and
  decisions, plus `GET /api/events`. An idle chat streams nothing (`204`) and stops at once; user
  B (`otherToken`) gets `404` for user A's chat on every one of them, never `CHAT_BUSY`. Bruno has
  no model provider or tool server, so its chat cannot answer; the route tests on Postgres cover
  live runs, reattaching after a `seq`, stop, regenerate, retry, edits, the shutdown drain,
  recovery after a restart, tool calls, approvals, and the user event stream.
}
